X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/carlson-kids-art-library-200548"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Carlson Kids! Art at the Library!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T120000
UID:5df706e4a166670e2c342b8a07819869@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Children\, Tweens\n\nAges 5-12\, children unde
 r 8 should have responsible caregiver present.Our main program room is nam
 ed for Charles X. Carlson\, the notable local artist. And what more fittin
 g purpose than to use it to inspire a new generation of artists! Carlson K
 ids is a new grant-funded program that brings together a local art teacher
 \, some aspiring teen coaches\, and young future artists!  Students will d
 o art activities in similar styles to Charlie Carlson's work\, which inclu
 des watercolor\, collage\, cartooning\, and some experimental projects. Th
 is program will be offered on one Thursday afternoon and one Saturday afte
 rnoon per month. You may register for any sessions you wish\, attendance a
 t all sessions is not mandatory. We gratefully acknowledge the C. X. Carls
 on Cultural Trust Fund for their generosity in providing this program to o
 ur community.
LOCATION:Quarryville\, QVL C.X. Carlson Cultural Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/carlson-kids-art-library
 -200548
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/duplo-free-play-169288"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Duplo Free Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T150000
UID:cae386b3919f24f2f12a47c0da025a07@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nDrop-in program. No registration
  required.Join us for a fun and engaging play session designed for childre
 n ages 2-7! Using colorful Lego Duplo blocks\, kids can explore their crea
 tivity\, improve fine motor skills\, and build their imagination through h
 ands-on play. This program encourages collaborative play and parent-child 
 interaction.Perfect for young builders of all skill levels\, this free pro
 gram offers a relaxed and welcoming environment for families to connect an
 d create together. Come play\, learn\, and grow at the library! Each famil
 y group must include a responsible adult in the room at all times. This pr
 ogram is for children 2 to 7 years old only! While other ages are welcome 
 in the room\, we kindly ask that the play area and toys remain reserved ex
 clusively for the intended age group to ensure a safe environment for youn
 g participants.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/duplo-free-play-169288
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
