DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nDi
 scover the hidden history right beneath our feet! Join Sam Mecum and Kenn 
 Lefever from Grave Concern\, Inc. for an engaging look at the historic bur
 ial grounds of Lancaster County and Manheim Township. From forgotten famil
 y plots to recent preservation efforts at the Meister cemetery near the La
 ncaster Airport\, learn how local historians protect these vital pieces of
  our community's heritage-- and what happens when modern development meets
  historic sites.Registration is encouraged!
