UID:f1fee555fe6e2b56e7ba67b592b234cc@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, November 18th for Manheim Townsh
 ip and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, November 20th for residents
  of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are li
 mited to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- 
 Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has 
 not been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registratio
 n for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regi
 stering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please can
 cel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program 
 to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in r
 egistration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the
  start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The pr
 ogram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot
  will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If
  spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, reg
 istrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the sta
 rt time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/book-babies-pm-session-1
 69745
