SUMMARY:Ephrata Dutch Long or Short Rides-Long 39H\; 23H
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Standing Saturday rides
  for December. Attendance will depend on the weather.**\n\n**Please RSVP s
 o other know they are not riding alone. Volunteer to lead if you can.**\n\
 n**Ride leader: (volunteer to lead!)**\n**Short**\n**Long**\n**Ride sweep:
  (volunteer to sweep!)**\n**Anticipated Average Pace: 12-16 mph depending 
 on the group**\n\n**Route:** [LV Ephrata Dutch Long](https://routes.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/route/lv-ephrata-dutch-long/)\n[LV Ephrata Dutch Short](ht
 tps://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/route/lv-ephrata-dutch-short/)\n\n**Be 
 Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\n**The ride leaders to name their 
 pace. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main 
 goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with
  occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to 
 pace capabilities.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring 
 water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator
 ).**\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LB
 C Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup
  does not mean you are a club member. Join here** [Member Signup](https://
 www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Your 
 RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct:** [Code of 
 Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=323984)\n**Guidance if an incident occurs:** [Incident A
 ctions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2571
 48&module_id=326137)
