SUMMARY:Medicare Enrollment Class with Linda Sholly
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
UID:cbc5ac385dd7a3e0e76dcb3579499513@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Finance\, Health & Wellness\, Adults\
 , Seniors\n\nFree Medicare Enrollment & Benefits Class — Get Your Questi
 ons Answered!Turning 65 soon\, or looking to get more out of your current 
 health coverage? Join us for a free\, informative Medicare Enrollment Clas
 s designed to help you understand your options and make confident decision
 s.Whether you are enrolling for the first time or looking to pair Medicare
  with your existing insurance to pick up extra coverage\, we’ll walk you
  through how everything works together—and how even a baseline plan can 
 save you big in the long run.What You’ll Learn:Eligibility & Coordinatio
 n: How Medicare works for individuals 65 and older (plus qualifying except
 ions) and how it coordinates alongside your current employer or private in
 surance.Beyond Basic Coverage: How Medicare and Medicare Advantage plans c
 an help cover major procedures like knee replacement surgery as well as ev
 eryday essentials—including glasses\, contacts\, dental checkups\, filli
 ngs\, crowns\, hearing aids\, and more.Simple\, Affordable Payment Options
 : How plan premiums can be conveniently deducted straight from your Social
  Security benefit or paycheck so you never have to worry about missing a b
 ill.Special Guest Q&A with Linda: Bring your questions! Our special guest\
 , Linda\, will be on hand to answer anything on your mind—from comparing
  plan types to recommending coverage options tailored to your household's 
 specific health needs and budget.Come chat with us\, grab helpful resource
 s\, and get clarity on your healthcare future—at zero cost and with zero
  obligation!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/medicare-enrollment-clas
 s-linda-sholly-214187
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
