X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-209792"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Handling the Holidays: Keep Your Glow On ✨
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261208T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261208T194500
UID:49a3bfc38ab4236716f08bfac3ecdc81@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Health & Wellness\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe holidays bring joy
 \, but they can also bring overwhelm\, busy schedules\, and unexpected cur
 veballs. Join us for an empowering session focused on staying grounded\, p
 rotecting your peace\, and navigating the season with confidence. We’ll 
 cover practical boundary-setting\, stress reduction\, and thoughtful budge
 t-friendly standby gift ideas ($25 and under!) so you’re prepared for wh
 atever comes your way. Walk away with tactical tools\, recommended reading
 \, and a game plan to keep glowing all month long.✨
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-209792
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
