BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/bird-in-hand-christmas-village/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261212T150000
DTSTAMP:20261102T115633Z
CREATED:20261019T144235Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261102T115633Z
UID:10001078-1797069600-1797087600@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Bird-in-Hand Christmas Village
DESCRIPTION:A Bird-in-Hand Holiday Tradition \nSaturday\, December 12 • 10 a.m.–3 p.m. \nBird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe • Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village \n  \nMeet Santa\, play mini-golf\, snuggle with goats and much more! \nSanta is coming back to Bird-in-Hand\, with fun for young and young-at-heart alike. This year’s festivities will be “above par” with the addition of mini golf! Join us at our Bird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe and Bird-in-Hand Artisan Village and create great Christmas season memories! \nImagine the great photos you can get when the kids cuddle with goats in their PJs! Get a head start on holiday shopping and take an old-fashioned hayride. Holiday balloons are back\, and so is the Snowflake Station\, where you can warm up with yummy hot chocolate and more. With so much for everyone\, you’ll want to make a day of it! \n  \nSend Your Letters to Santa!\nNovember 27–December 12 \nLook for Santa’s Mail Drops at both our Bakery & Cafe and Artisan Village. \n  \nBring a can\, get a coupon!\nWe’ll be collecting donations for Conestoga Valley Christian Community Services. Bring a canned good and get a coupon for 10% off your purchase at our Bakery & Cafe. \n  \nJoin us for a full day of festivities for the whole family! \nAt our Bakery & Cafe \n\nMeet Santa Claus\nPlay a round of mini golf across from the Snowflake Station\nSnuggle with baby goats in their holiday PJs ($5)\nTake a hayride around the village (10 am – 2 pm)\nHoliday balloons and face painting for the kids\nDecorate your own Christmas cookie ($6)\nCaroling with the cast of The Christmas Rush (10 – 11 am)\nTreat yourself to something delicious from our Snowflake Station\, including hot chocolate and holiday baked goods\nEnjoy breakfast or lunch at our Bakery & Cafe or our Restaurant & Smorgasbord\nDrop off your donation (funds or canned goods) for Conestoga Valley Christian Community Services\n\nAt Artisan Village \n\nFirst 50 kids receive a gift from Artisan Village\nDIY craft kit for kids (while supplies last)\nLive music with Jackson Houston (11 am – 2 pm)\nSand art activity for kids\nBring new\, unwrapped toys for Toys for Tots\nLast day to use your Lancaster Best Kept Secrets Tour ticket\n\n 
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/bird-in-hand-christmas-village/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe\, 2715 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird-in-Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/christmasvillage2026header.jpg
GEO:40.0387714;-76.1781885
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Bird-in-Hand Bakery & Cafe 2715 Old Philadelphia Pike Bird-in-Hand PA 17505 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2715 Old Philadelphia Pike:geo:-76.1781885,40.0387714
END:VEVENT
