X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bird In Hand": "https://bird-in-hand.com/event/make-take-christmas-coffee-cozie/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bird_in_hand
X-SOURCE:Bird-in-Hand
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261219
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261220
DTSTAMP:20261118T132955Z
CREATED:20261118T132955Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T132955Z
UID:10001084-1797638400-1797724799@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Make & Take: Christmas Coffee Cozie
DESCRIPTION:Learn to crochet colorful holiday gifts \nTry your hand at crochet and go home with a cute Christmas coffee cozie set suitable for gifting. In this-two-hour workshop for beginners\, local artist Paula Hughes of Soft and Simple Designs will guide you through the process of selecting yarn\, crocheting a cozie for a coffee cup and packaging it in a gift bag along with a packet of hot chocolate. You can also attach a small crocheted wreath to the cozie\, or use the wreath as an ornament to decorate a tree or trim a gift package. \nPaula Hughes will show you basic crochet stitches and answer your questions about this relaxing art of turning soft yarns into useful and decorative items. \nThis Make & Take is also appropriate for kids ages 10 and up. Reserve your space today! \n$22 per person includes instruction and all supplies for a ready-to-give handmade gift (red or green yarn for cozie\, disposable cup\, wreath kit\, decorative button\, hot chocolate\, gift bag). \nDate: Saturday\, December 19 \nTimes: 10 a.m. and 2 p.m. \nTo save your space: Call (717) 344-6875. Reservations strongly recommended.
