 you’re a fan of gritty noir\, cozy mysteries\, or psychological thriller
 s\, the Mystery Book Club is looking for new investigators to join our ran
 ks for the 2027 season.Join us on the 2nd Monday of each month at 7pm as w
 e dive into a new page-turner\, dissect the clues\, and see if anyone mana
 ged to crack the case before the final chapter. It’s a year of suspense\
 , great conversation\, and maybe a few red herrings along the way.Registra
 tion is encouragedJanuary 11 - State of Terror by Hillary Rodham Clinton a
 nd Louise PennyRest of book list TBD
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mystery-book-club-213787
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
