DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🀄️✨Join us for
  a morning of strategy\, skill\, and socializing! 🀄️✨Whether you ar
 e a seasoned pro or a newcomer looking to practice\, come enjoy the classi
 c game of tiles in a friendly atmosphere\, every Wednesday from 10-1.Note:
  This is a self-directed community group. While no formal instructor is pr
 ovided\, players of all levels are welcome to learn from one another. What
  to Bring: Sets and racks (at least one per four players)Your current 2026
  National Mah Jongg League cardA friendly\, patient attitude! Community Gu
 idelinesBe Welcoming:  We all started as beginners! Please be patient with
  those still learning to playThe "Rule of Five": If a fifth player joins y
 our table\, we suggest the "East Sits Out" rotation—the player in the Ea
 st position rotates out for one hand so everyone gets to playFair Play:  T
 ables are available on a first-come\, first-served basisPlease keep talk i
 nclusive and the atmosphere kindRegistration is Required for this event!Th
 is program is for adults ages +18
