DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, January 6th for Manheim Township
  and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, January 8th for residents of 
 other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limite
 d to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Plea
 se check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not 
 been cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration fo
 r more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from register
 ing for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel 
 your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to a
 llow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in regis
 tration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the sta
 rt of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The progra
 m will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot wil
 l be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spo
 ts remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registr
 ants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start t
 ime.
