X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Parachute Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270125T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270125T104500
UID:b8e4ce634b22e1f429173aec24c41482@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nJoin us for a cooperative m
 ovement program where we will use our imaginations while we play with a pa
 rachute! Stories and songs will be incorporated\, while we move about and 
 use our motor skills. A great activity for young children and their adults
  to come together and share an exciting and engaging play experience! (Mus
 t be 18 months-younger 3 years old with an adult\, adult involvement is re
 quired)Adults attending with their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Ple
 ase add any additional registrants to your registration if more than one c
 hild that will be participating in the program.Registration will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\,January 13th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter re
 sidents and on Friday\, January 15th for residents of other municipalities
 .Storytime PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registratio
 n for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regi
 stering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please can
 cel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program 
 to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in r
 egistration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the
  start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The pr
 ogram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot
  will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If
  spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, reg
 istrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the sta
 rt time.Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children to
  enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Dro
 p offs will not be permitted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior 
 to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.Program Lim
 its - Patrons are limited to one session of multiple session programs per 
 week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/parachute-play-175248
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
