  be covered include sending and receiving emails as well as navigating som
 e Outlook-specific features. Attendees should have an Outlook email addres
 s and password. Laptops will be provided for in-class use. Participants sh
 ould create an Outlook account before class. Please schedule an appointmen
 t with a computer tutor or utilize the library lab hours if you need help 
 creating the account. Bring your email account and password to class so yo
 u can practice!
