DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🀄️✨Join us for
  an afternoon of strategy\, skill\, and socializing! 🀄️✨Can't make 
 it to our morning or evening session? Pull up a chair for an afternoon of 
 Mahjong fun! Note: This is a self-directed community group. While no forma
 l instructor is provided\, players of all levels are welcome to learn from
  one another. What to Bring: Sets and racks (at least one per four players
 )Your current 2026 National Mah Jongg League cardA friendly\, patient atti
 tude! Community GuidelinesBe Welcoming:  We all started as beginners! Plea
 se be patient with those still learning to playThe "Rule of Five": If a fi
 fth player joins your table\, we suggest the "East Sits Out" rotation—th
 e player in the East position rotates out for one hand so everyone gets to
  playFair Play:  Tables are available on a first-come\, first-served basis
 Please keep talk inclusive and the atmosphere kindRegistration is Required
  for this eventThis program is for adults aged +18
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
