DESCRIPTION:Tech Lancaster Meetups\nWe will be upstairs in "The Sanctuary"
  - when you walk in the main entrance just head up the stairs! We will hav
 e signs as you walk in to guide you.\nPizza is provided free upstairs. Bee
 r/wine/soda/etc at the bar downstairs!\n\nThis months speakers:\n**TBA**\n
 Have something you want to share? Lets us know and maybe fill in a hole!\n
 \nTypical schedule of events:\n\n6:30 PM Doors Open/Pizza/Mingle\n7:00 PM 
 Introduction/Announcements\n7:05 PM First Speaker\n7:35 PM Break\n7:45 PM 
 Speaker 2\n8:15 PM End
